{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "lib": ["ES2022", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "Bundler",

    /* dist/ mirrors the whole project one level deeper (dist/index.js, dist/src/kit.js, ...).
       Every relative import stays exactly as written — tsc doesn't rewrite specifiers, and the
       mirrored structure means "../kit.js" still finds the right sibling inside dist/ — so the
       only two things that had to change for the move are index.html's own <script src> (now
       "./dist/index.js") and the CLI scripts' data/*.json resolution (one extra ".." to cross
       the added nesting level; see team.ts/run.ts). allowJs stays on even though every file is
       now .ts, just so a stray .js dropped in later still gets swept into the build. */
    "outDir": "dist",
    "rootDir": ".",

    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": false,

    "strict": true,
    "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": true,
    "noImplicitOverride": true,

    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "sourceMap": true,
    "declaration": false
  },
  "include": ["index.ts", "src/**/*"],
  /* display.ts is restored — kit.ts now exports ResolvedSnapshot/StatEntry/ChainGroup so it
     compiles against the new engine unmodified (see kit.ts's own header on those types).
     optimize.ts/run.ts/team.ts are still the old CLI/report-building harness for the OLD engine
     (Loadout, ResonatorFactory, Resonator) with no port yet — team.ts/run.ts are CLI-only
     (unrelated to index.ts) and optimize.ts's weapon optimizer isn't wired into the restored
     site. The 21 resonators below are back in the tree (kept for reference / not to lose the
     work) but not yet ported to the new engine's Buff/Gear shape — restore each one to "include"
     as it gets ported, same as phrolova/qiuyuan/cantarella already were. */
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules", "dist", "src/optimize.ts", "src/run.ts", "src/team.ts", "src/shared/tunebreak.ts",
    "src/resonators/brant.ts", "src/resonators/buling.ts",
    "src/resonators/camellya.ts", "src/resonators/changli.ts",
    "src/resonators/danjin.ts", "src/resonators/encore.ts", "src/resonators/galbrena.ts",
    "src/resonators/jianxin.ts",
    "src/resonators/lucilla.ts", "src/resonators/lupa.ts"
  ]
}
